# Flutter Windows Launch Size

Always run the app in a window sized to match an **iPhone 15 Pro** portrait screen.

- Width: `393` logical pixels  
- Height: `852` logical pixels  

This is set in `windows/runner/main.cpp`:

```cpp
Win32Window::Point origin(10, 10);
Win32Window::Size size(393, 852);
```

Never change this size back to 1280 × 720 or any other desktop size unless the user explicitly asks.
